  "note": "Every aura loop is split: a back half behind the figure, and a front half in front. The front half is the lower part of the picture only, faded in over the middle of the body so the face stays clear: it is made of `steps` copies cut from a line that moves from `fadeFrom` to `fadeTo` (shares of the drawn effect's height from its top), each at frontAlpha / steps, so it grows stronger toward the feet.",
